-- MOVEMENT SCRIPT v29
-- ==========================================
-- CHANGES FROM v28:
--
--  FIX 1 - Signed angular velocity (futureCF drift fix)
--    av was computed as a cross product magnitude and lost
--    its sign when the laser rotated past 180 degrees.
--    Now computed as the signed Y component of the cross
--    product, so prediction never drifts direction.
--
--  FIX 2 - scorePos uses per-threat arrival time
--    Each threat is now evaluated at t = clamp(tti, 0.1, 2.0)
--    (the actual moment it arrives at the player) instead of
--    a fixed t = tti*0.5 fraction that was wrong for both
--    very short and very long TTI values.
--
--  FIX 3 - Safe-spot cache invalidated on laser movement
--    getBestSafe now invalidates cachedSafe if any tracked
--    threat has moved more than 2 studs since the last cache
--    fill, rather than blindly trusting a 100ms-old result.
--
--  FIX 4 - mustJumpToAvoid checks ALL threats
--    Previously only the primary threat was checked.
--    Now loops over every active threat and returns true
--    if ANY of them requires a jump.
--
--  FIX 5 - Dive ChangeState retry loop
--    hum:ChangeState(Jumping) is now retried up to 3
--    consecutive Heartbeat frames if the humanoid is not
--    yet in Freefall/Jumping state, catching cases where
--    Roblox silently drops the first call.
--
--  FIX 6 - Denser dive fall sampling
--    DIVE_FALL_STEPS raised from 8 to 20 to close the
--    gaps a fast-rotating laser can slip through.
--
--  All v28 arc physics, viz, HUD, and dive planning unchanged.
-- ==========================================
